    "*Hypothesis 1 — Weather and delays*\n",
    "\n",
    "Severe weather conditions are associated with higher flight delays. --> Use weather_daily_raw to identify days with high precipitation, snow, or strong winds, and flights to compare average delays.\n",
    "\n",
    "*Hypothesis 2 — Snow and cancellations*\n",
    "\n",
    "Flights are more likely to be cancelled on days with significant snowfall. --> This lets you connect the weather data with the flight cancellation data.\n",
    "\n",
    "*Hypothesis 3 — Airport differences*\n",
    "\n",
    "The impact of bad weather on flight delays differs between airports."
   ]
