   "source": [
    "# EDA: Winter Storm Elliott (22-29 Dec 2022) - weather vs. flight traffic\n",
    "**Data**: flights from 6 origin airports (BUF, ORD, MDW, LGA, DEN, BNA), Nov 2022 - Jan 2023, and Meteostat daily weather for the same airports.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Hypotheses**\n",
    "1. **H1**: the storm is visible in the weather data (temperature drop, snow, wind).\n",
    "2. **H2**: the storm is visible in the flights data (cancellations and delays spike during the event).\n",
    "3. **H3**: After the storm ends, air traffic returns to normal quickly (the cancellation rate falls back to its usual level within a few days)."
   ]
  },
